Modifications (QiuShenClaw)

QiuShenClaw — a fork of BossClaw, renamed and maintained by 余胜辉 (Yu Shenghui).

Material modifications made in this fork include:
  1. Project renaming: BossClaw -> QiuShenClaw (branding and packaging
     metadata; internal technical identifiers kept compatible on purpose).
  2. userData migration: on first launch the legacy %APPDATA%\BossClaw
     directory is automatically migrated to %APPDATA%\QiuShenClaw so that
     platform login sessions are preserved.
  3. Additional functional fixes and enhancements (see repository history).

